        "Description": "47, we have an issue.\r\rIntel indicates that four of our employees have switched sides and joined a shadow organization which goes by the name of &apos;SYSMIC&apos;. Your mission is to infiltrate the SYSMIC compound in Chongqing, then find and elimininate these turncoats before they leak any more confidential information to SYSMIC.\r\rSharon Reed: Ex-Data Caretaker\rXiao Ming: Ex-Handler\rBerrie Kearney: Ex-Cyber Security Specialist\rHui Hou: Ex-Date Processor",
